# Agent tooling writes state into this repository. Ignoring it keeps `git status`
# honest and stops a stray `git add -A` from sweeping it into a commit.
# `hextap dev validate` consults these rules too, so ignored state mutating
# mid-run cannot produce a false `working tree changed during validation`.

# oh-my-claudecode operational state. `.omc/skills/**` is the intentional
# committable exception for project-scoped skills, so the direct children of
# `.omc/` are ignored individually rather than the directory as a whole — Git
# cannot re-include a path underneath an excluded directory.
/.omc/*
!/.omc/skills/

# Serena project memories and language-server cache. `project.yml` is the one
# exception. It is Serena's schema-versioned project config, and Serena rewrites
# it in place whenever its own version is newer than the file's. This repo is
# checked out six times, so leaving it untracked means six independent rewrites
# and six copies free to diverge; tracking it turns a schema migration into one
# reviewable commit that every checkout pulls. Same negation shape as
# `.omc/skills/` above, and for the same reason.
/.serena/*
!/.serena/project.yml

# Claude Code's local (per-checkout, uncommitted) project memory. Ignored rather
# than merely untracked so that editing it cannot make `dev validate` report
# `working tree changed during validation`.
/CLAUDE.local.md

# macOS Finder metadata, which Finder can drop into any directory at any time.
.DS_Store
